{"id":17121,"name":"Lorain County","slug":"lorain-county","state":"Ohio","code":"OH","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/lorain-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:15","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deeds","typicalSaleDate":"Designated Wednesdays","bidProcedure":"Premium bid","redemptionPeriod":"Not applicable for tax deed sales","interestRate":"Not applicable for tax deed sales","deposit":"A cashier’s check is required for bidding","extra":[{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Lorain County Administration Building"},{"label":"Contact Information","value":"Sheriff’s Office: (440) 329-5787"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"wB4zRFAh24a5xEgwYPS9QX1kKpKeqgAYNDDGVjjmO0rWiv5dcfmxUUsudP0JbcZGb98oEvH7BZMz2nI8fhun6HlkrCieTt3lJ\"><iframe title=\"40-90% Discounts on Properties - Lorain County - Ohio Tax Lien &amp; Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/U6M5SJ8JAfk?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Discover-Property-Deals-at-40-90%-Discounts:-Lorain-County,-Ohio-Tax-Lien-&amp;-Deed-Investing\">Find Property Deals at 40-90% Off in Lorain County, Ohio Tax Sales</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Lorain County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ohio</mark></a>, presents an exciting opportunity for investors to acquire properties at a fraction of their market value through tax deed sales. With a population of over 313,000, this County is a promising location for real estate investments.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Lorain-County-Tax-Deed-Information\">Lorain County Tax Deed Information</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Auction Location</strong>: County Administration Building, Commissioner’s Public Hearing Room, 4th Floor, 226 Middle Ave, Elyria, Ohio 44035</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Auction Dates</strong>: Designated Wednesdays, starting at 10:00 a.m.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Sheriff’s Sales Information</strong>: <a href=\"https://loraincountysheriff.com/lorain-county-sheriffs-sales/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Sheriff’s Sales</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Contact Information</strong>:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Sheriff’s Office</strong>: <a href=\"https://loraincountysheriff.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Sheriff’s Office</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>County Treasurer</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.lctreasurer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>General County Information</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.loraincountyohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Website</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-Tax-Deed-Sales-Work-in-Lorain-County\">How Tax Deed Sales Work in Lorain County?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Auction Type</strong>: Tax deed sales are conducted via live verbal auctions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Bidding Process</strong>: The highest bid accepted by the Sheriff results in a legally binding contract under Ohio law.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Preparation</strong>: Come prepared with proper identification and a cashier’s check to place your bid.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Property Inspection</strong>: Properties sold at auction cannot be viewed before the sale. Use the county assessor’s website and other resources for due diligence.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Auction-Details\">Important Auction Details</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elyria-ohio-old-county-building-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17129 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Elyria, Lorain County, Ohio old county building\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips-for-Bidders\">Pro Tips for Bidders in Lorain County</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Stay Updated</strong>: Sale dates can change, so regularly check the <a href=\"https://loraincountysheriff.com/lorain-county-sheriffs-sales/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Sheriff’s website</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">.</mark></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Research</strong>: Conduct thorough research on properties using the assessor&#8217;s website.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Health Precautions</strong>: If you feel unwell, prioritize your health, as there will always be another opportunity.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">Lorain County Tax Sale FAQs</h4>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What is the difference between a tax lien and a tax deed sale?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>A:</strong> In a tax lien sale, investors purchase the lien on the property, earning interest if the owner redeems it. In a tax deed sale, investors purchase the property outright, usually at a significant discount.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Can I view the properties before the auction?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>A:</strong> No, properties cannot be inspected before the sale. Use the assessor’s website for property details.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What should I bring to the auction?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>A:</strong> Bring proper identification and a cashier’s check for the deposit.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For further details and to explore upcoming auctions, visit the <a href=\"https://loraincountysheriff.com/lorain-county-sheriffs-sales/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Lorain County Sheriff’s Sales</mark></a> page.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://loraincountysheriff.com/lorain-county-sheriffs-sales/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Sheriff’s Sales</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.lctreasurer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.loraincountyohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Official Website</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Seize the opportunity to invest in Lorain County and maximize your returns through tax deed sales! <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Book a call</mark></a> now to create your personalized investment plan!</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}